{"4683050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Order Of The Damned", "steam_appid": 4683050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Order Of The Damned is a dark-fantasy action-RPG from the shadows of Arthurian legend.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683050/extras/0a6b209ff6adf6dedd0838dd229ac8d9.avif?t=1785051033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683050/extras_big/0a6b209ff6adf6dedd0838dd229ac8d9.webp?t=1785051033 width=1560 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683050/extras/20ca2eb87626545eb4d7fcb2ccce7847.webp?t=1785051033\" width=352 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Duran, one of the last of a fallen order. Shape a legend on a haunting quest where the choices you make determine your ultimate fate - and that of your world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683050/extras/640de3ad9c2a0e702e135d3b8c842d00.avif?t=1785051033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683050/extras_big/640de3ad9c2a0e702e135d3b8c842d00.webp?t=1785051033 width=1560 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683050/extras/98191327e38432f924429a801bc24ee9.webp?t=1785051033\" width=216 height=28 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the lands of a ruined world, from dark forests to barren wastelands, as you discover the faded legends of a mythical post-Roman Britain. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683050/extras/33224e680827982016894ad2df24bc0a.avif?t=1785051033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683050/extras_big/33224e680827982016894ad2df24bc0a.webp?t=1785051033 width=1560 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683050/extras/b78ddfb7fcf6fa9827fb8ce371eae4f3.webp?t=1785051033\" width=210 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the way of the warrior, the arcane, or a path of your own. Combine brutal real-time combat and harness the Spectre to unleash supernatural devastation on your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683050/extras/6e8f5e91f816de7c7039140d19787015.avif?t=1785051033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683050/extras_big/6e8f5e91f816de7c7039140d19787015.webp?t=1785051033 width=1560 height=360 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683050/extras/3afd4b8f064a47c5aa7de43a29b0fb28.avif?t=1785051033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683050/extras_big/3afd4b8f064a47c5aa7de43a29b0fb28.webp?t=1785051033 width=1560 height=360 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683050/extras/707eff9a5b20432ee41af83070b03aee.avif?t=1785051033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683050/extras_big/707eff9a5b20432ee41af83070b03aee.webp?t=1785051033 width=1560 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683050/extras/dba131225b70396c1dc219f4e73da082.webp?t=1785051033\" width=305 height=28 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric dark-fantasy world with a classic RPG soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683050/extras/5f978cd720f4f45b1193c1f3d2c31cc4.avif?t=1785051033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683050/extras_big/5f978cd720f4f45b1193c1f3d2c31cc4.webp?t=1785051033 width=1560 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Order Of The Damned is a dark-fantasy action-RPG from the shadows of Arthurian legend.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683050/extras/0a6b209ff6adf6dedd0838dd229ac8d9.avif?t=1785051033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683050/extras_big/0a6b209ff6adf6dedd0838dd229ac8d9.webp?t=1785051033 width=1560 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragr