dfb7fcf6fa9827fb8ce371eae4f3.webp?t=1785051033\" width=210 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the way of the warrior, the arcane, or a path of your own. Combine brutal real-time combat and harness the Spectre to unleash supernatural devastation on your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683050/extras/6e8f5e91f816de7c7039140d19787015.avif?t=1785051033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683050/extras_big/6e8f5e91f816de7c7039140d19787015.webp?t=1785051033 width=1560 height=360 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683050/extras/3afd4b8f064a47c5aa7de43a29b0fb28.avif?t=1785051033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683050/extras_big/3afd4b8f064a47c5aa7de43a29b0fb28.webp?t=1785051033 width=1560 height=360 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683050/extras/707eff9a5b20432ee41af83070b03aee.avif?t=1785051033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683050/extras_big/707eff9a5b20432ee41af83070b03aee.webp?t=1785051033 width=1560 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683050/extras/dba131225b70396c1dc219f4e73da082.webp?t=1785051033\" width=305 height=28 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric dark-fantasy world with a classic RPG soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste